                          "classes": [
                            "text-text-muted",
                            "leading-relaxed"
                          ],
                          "text": "\n          {brand.name} is an industrial manufacturers representative covering the\n          mid to southern Atlantic and Gulf Coast. We connect the manufacturers we\n          represent with the distributors and end users who need them — and we stay\n          involved long after the introduction.\n        "
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "r-p-32a",
                          "tag": "p",
